@startuml
title Staff Member Class State Machine Diagram

state Unassigned
state AssignedToClient
state AssignedToCampaign
state Unemployed
state Archived

[*] --> LoggedIn

LoggedIn --> Assign : assignStaffMember
Assign --> AssignedToClient : assignedToClient
Assign --> AssignedToCampaign : assignedToCampaign

AssignedToClient SwitchAssignment --> Unassigned
AssignedToCampaign SwitchAssignment --> Unassigned

Unassigned RemoveAssignment --> Unemployed

Unemployed LeaveJob --> Unemployed
Unemployed Archive --> Archived

Unemployed --> [*] : leaveJob or archiveRecord
@enduml
